From 3c24bfdb499631a19ea3563f4dee92c8cf37bc62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:51:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] test-posix: Check setpgid, setsid and tcsetpgrp in
 sessions and groups

setpgid's errors, setsid's EPERM for a group named after the caller,
and tcsetpgrp's SIGTTOU and EINTR from the background, EIO from an
orphaned group, EPERM for a group that doesn't exist, the value of
tcgetpgrp once the foreground group has gone, and no controlling
terminal after setsid.
